## 16. {{ t.evolution.sections.conclusion }}

**Tendance :** {% if trend_is_structural %}{{ t.evolution.trend.structural }}{% else %}{{ t.evolution.trend.temporary }}{% endif %} — {{ trend_breadth_label }}

{% if delta_avg_score >= 0.5 and trend_breadth == "breed" %}
